s and attendance issues","lead":"Shared services support core council functions; staffing gaps could affect service delivery across multiple council operations and financial management.","iso":"2026-07-02","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","byline":"PWLBintel \u00b7 from committee papers","draft":true},{"headline":"Current IT staffing levels below requirements despite business case inclusion","lead":"A gap between planned and actual staffing creates delivery risk; if staffing numbers don't materialise, critical infrastructure improvements including cyber risk remediation could be delayed.","iso":"2026-07-02","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","byline":"PWLBintel \u00b7 from committee papers","draft":true},{"headline":"Unsupported Windows 10 systems identified as creating a cyber risk","lead":"Cyber vulnerabilities from unsupported systems create material operational and business continuity risk; a breach could disrupt services and require expensive remediation.","iso":"2026-07-02","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","byline":"PWLBintel \u00b7 from committee papers","draft":true}],"findings":[{"iso":"2026-07-02","committee":"Standards & Audit Sub Board","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","headline":"Shared service staffing has identified vulnerabilities and attendance issues","detail":"The Standards & Audit Sub Board has noted that staffing in shared services has vulnerabilities and experiences attendance issues, which create an acknowledged service risk tracked as the Loss of Key Staff Strategic Risk.","category":"people","matters":"Shared services support core council functions; staffing gaps could affect service delivery across multiple council operations and financial management.","figures":"none","quote":"All recognized that shared service staffing has vulnerabilities and there are sometimes issues with attendance which creates a risk covered by the Loss of Key Staff Strategic Risk","material":true},{"iso":"2026-07-02","committee":"Standards & Audit Sub Board","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","headline":"Current IT staffing levels below requirements despite business case inclusion","detail":"The council acknowledges insufficient IT manpower is currently in place, although this staffing need has been built into the business case for the IT Improvement Programme. Specialist requirements have been identified and Microsoft licensing enhancements are being explored.","category":"people","matters":"A gap between planned and actual staffing creates delivery risk; if staffing numbers don't materialise, critical infrastructure improvements including cyber risk remediation could be delayed.","figures":"none","quote":"although sufficient manpower was not currently in place it was built into the business case and some specialist requirement had been identified","material":true},{"iso":"2026-07-02","committee":"Standards & Audit Sub Board","paper_title":"Minutes Public Pack, 26/03/2026 Standards &amp; Audit Sub Board","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6978/6978.pdf","headline":"Unsupported Windows 10 systems identified as creating a cyber risk","detail":"The council has desktop and laptop computers still running unsupported Windows 10, which the Head of IT has explicitly flagged as creating a cyber security risk. A budget bid focuses on this as a critical requirement for replacement or upgrade.","category":"other","matters":"Cyber vulnerabilities from unsupported systems create material operational and business continuity risk; a breach could disrupt services and require expensive remediation.","figures":"none","quote":"a bid in the budget focused on critical requirements such as desk top and laptops still on now unsupported Windows 10 creating a cyber risk","material":true},{"iso":"2026-07-02","committee":"Standards & Audit Sub Board","paper_title":"Appendix A - Annual Governance Statement GBC 2526 FINAL","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6975/6975.pdf","headline":"Workforce capacity severely stretched by Local Government Reorganisation on a lean organisation","detail":"The council is 'a small and very lean organisation' with 'many staff covering multiple responsibilities.' LGR commitments will 'place significant demands on existing senior staff' and 'create additional capacity pressures' that could impact governance delivery.","category":"people","matters":"A lean workforce already stretched thin, facing simultaneous financial transformation and LGR delivery, creates material execution risk across financial, governance and service priorities.","figures":"None","quote":"These ongoing workstreams will continue to create additional capacity pressures for a Council that already relies on a lean workforce, with many staff covering multiple responsibilities.","material":true},{"iso":"2026-07-02","committee":"Standards & Audit Sub Board","paper_title":"Appendix A - Annual Governance Statement GBC 2526 FINAL","paper_url":"https://gosport.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s6975/6975.pdf","headline":"Increasing limited assurance internal audit findings with poor follow-up completion","detail":"The council identifies 'Increasing number of Limited Assurance internal audits and reduction in follow up actions being completed' as a significant governance issue. Improvement initiatives were 'not as effective as desired.' Audit tracking and section performance management to be introduced.","category":"audit","matters":"Increasing limited assurance findings indicate control environment weakening; poor follow-up means issues persist, reflecting governance control concerns.","figures":"None specified","quote":"Increasing number of Limited Assurance internal audits and reduction in follow up actions being completed","material":true}],"editorial":null,"freshness":{"last_paper_iso":"2026-07-02"},"name":"Gosport","findings_total":64,"news_drafts_total":3}}